WEBVTT

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:04.040
Just being at your side,

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:16.160
Gentles my hearts to the point of disbelief

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:25.570
I thought I heard the sound of your footsteps behind me,

00:00:27.030 --> 00:00:35.720
I turned my head repeatedly, wishing you would appear...

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:41.740
...and then there you were

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:50.990
The beginning of a new love

00:00:51.310 --> 00:01:05.870
Is unknowingly, the beginning of our invisible love story

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:15.360
Hence, I shall never leave your side

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:24.540
I pledge to love you and only you

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:36.710
<i>I hear Shuji's heart beating,</i>

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:39.070
<i>"thump, thump".</i>

00:01:41.050 --> 00:01:46.620
<i>Even when we're apart,</i> <i>I can tell, you know.</i>

00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:51.320
<i>Why is it beating so fast right now?</i>

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:58.460
<i>What are you doing with this woman</i> <i>you call "Ms. Fuyumi"?</i>

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:04.470
Thanks.

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:07.710
Shuji...

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:09.740
Huh?

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:11.850
Sorry, it's nothing.

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:16.480
<i>Shuji...</i>

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:22.090
<i>Could that be the sound of love?</i>

00:02:27.700 --> 00:02:31.070
Hurry up and get here, Shuji!

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:34.160
I'm cold... I'm scared!

00:02:50.590 --> 00:02:52.150
It's so warm...

00:02:55.530 --> 00:02:56.720
Shuji...

00:03:01.460 --> 00:03:02.660
It's nothing.

00:03:03.840 --> 00:03:04.390
Ow!

00:03:05.840 --> 00:03:06.570
Huh?

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:21.160
Dummy!

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:31.160
<i>Shuji, let's go back to being</i> <i>just classmates.</i>

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:36.630
<i>Like before we became boyfriend</i> <i>and girlfriend.</i>

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:44.110
"Classmates"
Episode 6

00:03:47.530 --> 00:03:51.710
Chise, I must have a really dirty mind.

00:03:52.780 --> 00:03:56.190
I'm always thinking about having sex with you.

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:59.760
But then you get that look on your face,

00:03:59.980 --> 00:04:02.030
and you get all teary eyed.

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:06.430
And then I think about that scar on your chest,

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:09.290
and I feel like I might hurt you more.

00:04:10.340 --> 00:04:11.320
It scares me...

00:04:12.440 --> 00:04:17.270
What am I saying? I didn't mean to say that.

00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:19.640
Sorry, Chise.

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:25.270
Chise, do you remember Ms. Fuyumi?

00:04:26.020 --> 00:04:29.280
You know, that student teacher we had in middle school.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:35.020
She also helped with the track team,

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:37.850
so we called her by her first name.

00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:42.590
She told me I reminded her of her boyfriend.

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:43.500
Stop it.

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:49.300
They were apart for a long time,

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:52.900
so when she saw my face,

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:55.940
she thought of him and started crying.

00:04:58.420 --> 00:05:02.010
Suddenly, I didn't understand what was happening.

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:06.460
I thought, if she needed me like that, I couldn't ignore it.

00:05:07.890 --> 00:05:09.390
Don't tell me.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:12.560
Chise, in middle school...

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:16.260
No! I don't want to hear it! Let me go, Shuji!

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.270
I did it... with Ms. Fuyumi!

00:05:25.210 --> 00:05:28.040
Why? Why won't you let go?!

00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:30.780
Shuji, doesn't that hurt?!

00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:35.880
Just now... I was with Ms. Fuyumi!

00:05:49.370 --> 00:05:52.260
Why... can't you just lie?

00:05:56.610 --> 00:05:59.270
It wasn't anything, right?

00:06:00.650 --> 00:06:02.200
No, it wasn't.

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:06.980
Now you're crying.

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:09.410
You're crying.

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.950
Damn it... damn it!

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:13.650
Shuji...

00:06:13.910 --> 00:06:17.590
Chise, I still...

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:21.000
The one who always gets "that look" on his face...

00:06:21.070 --> 00:06:22.900
is you, Shuji!

00:06:23.500 --> 00:06:26.750
Don't ignore me! I'm not just a weapon!

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:28.720
I'm your girlfriend!

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:34.740
I've got lots of things I want to say but have to hold back, too!

00:06:35.050 --> 00:06:39.380
I get "that look" on my face? I was born with this face!

00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:41.650
The tears come by themselves!

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:46.480
The scar on my chest proves I'm still human!

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:51.660
When I'm with you, I'm your girlfriend.

00:06:51.730 --> 00:06:52.980
Your girlfriend!

00:06:55.030 --> 00:06:56.190
Believe me!

00:06:57.200 --> 00:07:00.760
If you want sex, why don't you say so?!

00:07:01.110 --> 00:07:04.470
Can't you see that, more than some Ms. Fuyumi,

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:11.110
a hundred times more, I want to have sex with you!

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:15.180
Why are you making a girl say this?!

00:07:16.920 --> 00:07:20.650
Anyone who finds someone who makes their heart race

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:22.280
would want to!

00:07:22.360 --> 00:07:23.730
Stupid, stupid, stupid!

00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:27.590
I wanted to believe that, when I was with you,

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:32.050
I was just a normal girl with her boyfriend.

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:50.920
Look... I'm... still a human being.

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:59.860
See? There's that look again.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.770
Sorry.

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:13.170
Shuji...

00:08:18.840 --> 00:08:23.180
Shuji, lets' go back to being just classmates.

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:37.360
<i>That day, we got yelled at for being</i> <i>two hours late for school.</i>

00:08:39.420 --> 00:08:43.000
<i>That day... we broke up.</i>

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:51.080
It's true! Someone at my sister's work saw it.

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:54.350
It showed the battlefield on the TV news.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:59.690
I heard about it, too. And they say the footage was horrible!

00:08:59.860 --> 00:09:02.830
Yeah. I wonder how the main island is doing...

00:09:03.260 --> 00:09:07.100
Shuji, how come Chise's not making your lunch anymore?

00:09:07.630 --> 00:09:09.500
We can't even get a can of coffee.

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:12.880
Who can make someone else's lunch these days?

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:17.430
That's no reason to treat poor Chise coldly.

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:20.540
Lately, you don't even walk her home.

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:22.290
Dummy, that's not the reason.

00:09:22.710 --> 00:09:26.280
That's right. Sometimes it's better hanging with the guys.

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:27.980
Guess so!

00:09:30.360 --> 00:09:32.690
Akemi turned me down.

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:39.150
I knew she would. She already likes someone.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:40.930
Really?

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:42.100
Yeah.

00:09:42.630 --> 00:09:45.730
Man! Who does Akemi think she is?!

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:50.030
But, Atsushi, don't let this guy beat you!

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:51.970
He'll be tough.

00:09:52.240 --> 00:09:53.010
I see.

00:09:57.180 --> 00:10:00.050
Shuji, I'm quitting school.

00:10:00.650 --> 00:10:02.240
To enlist?

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:05.280
Yup. So I can defend Akemi.

00:10:05.850 --> 00:10:08.720
That much, I think I can do.

00:10:08.990 --> 00:10:11.020
Atsushi,

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:14.260
it really is better with just the guys.

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:19.600
Girls are cute, of course, but they make no sense.

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:21.300
They're a pain.

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:25.570
Yeah, hanging with the guys is better.

00:10:40.770 --> 00:10:41.480
Chise...

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:46.990
Um... Bye-bye.

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:00.280
Shuji!

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:04.250
Hey.

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:09.410
Shouldn't Akemi's little sister be at practice?

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:14.490
Practice is just running around in circles.

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:20.060
Who knows if we'll ever have a track meet, the way things are now.

00:11:20.230 --> 00:11:21.170
It's dumb.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:25.230
I wish I had a boyfriend to hang out with.

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:29.370
You better take good care of your girlfriend, Shuji.

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:32.310
You always say something wrong.

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:34.480
We broke up.

00:11:36.980 --> 00:11:38.540
She's terrible.

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:42.510
Dumping you at a time like this.

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:44.590
Hold on! Dumping me?!

00:11:44.860 --> 00:11:48.550
If it were me, I'd want to be with him, especially now!

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:51.600
No matter how hard it can get!

00:11:52.170 --> 00:11:54.260
Dummy, shut up!

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:56.390
Shuji, that <i>hurts</i>!

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:00.570
Does my sister know?

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:04.710
Not yet. She'll be furious, for sure.

00:12:05.310 --> 00:12:08.040
She's intimidating, your sister.

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:25.560
See you!

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:57.490
I'm home.

00:12:58.470 --> 00:12:59.720
Shuji...

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:01.060
look.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:04.360
They're showing it on TV.

00:13:05.240 --> 00:13:07.900
Just as everyone's been saying.

00:13:09.770 --> 00:13:10.830
Is that Japan?

00:13:13.130 --> 00:13:15.480
<i>There... I saw her.</i>

00:13:17.050 --> 00:13:18.380
<i>I think it was her...</i>

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:24.310
<i>It had to be Chise.</i>

00:13:25.990 --> 00:13:30.020
Shuji, let's go back to being just classmates.

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:33.660
How can we?

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:38.160
That's impossible!

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:40.560
Damn it all!

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:12.260
<i>Classmates...</i>

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:16.800
Oh, Akemi... good morning.

00:14:17.310 --> 00:14:21.610
What's good about it? And what happened to you?

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:25.950
If you guys are fighting, hurry and make up.

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:30.820
'Cause I don't want to be caught in the middle and get hit again.

00:14:32.360 --> 00:14:35.850
Sorry, but, Akemi, I...

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:37.990
Don't tell me anything!

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:40.890
I'm not interested in your lovers' quarrel.

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:42.520
Akemi...

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:47.850
What do you see in him anyway?!

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:50.070
If it were me, I'd pass!

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:53.640
Wait, Akemi!

00:14:59.350 --> 00:15:02.080
'Morning.

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:07.290
<i>We're only classmates.</i>

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:10.320
What are you doing, Chise?

00:15:11.560 --> 00:15:13.150
I can't help you anymore.

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:16.300
She's pretty?

00:15:16.400 --> 00:15:17.090
Yeah.

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:19.100
Miho in second year.

00:15:19.340 --> 00:15:20.530
Don't, Nori.

00:15:21.140 --> 00:15:21.870
I agree.

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:24.570
As for girls...

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:26.680
you're not ready yet.

00:15:26.720 --> 00:15:27.670
True, true.

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:30.510
What's with you guys?

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:33.340
Nori, it's for your own good.

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:42.450
Tanks! They're bringing up tanks!

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:47.420
We don't even have mortars, let alone anti-tank shells!

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:50.730
Captain!

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:52.230
He's dead!

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:55.100
Damn it, we're finished!

00:15:55.570 --> 00:15:57.230
This is it!

00:15:59.780 --> 00:16:01.430
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:07.020
I'll take over from here.

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:10.680
Everyone, please evacuate,

00:16:11.090 --> 00:16:15.550
or else you'll be killed, too. And take the wounded with you.

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:19.460
Everyone, pull out! Follow me!

00:16:20.330 --> 00:16:20.850
Ow!

00:16:21.070 --> 00:16:22.000
Commander!

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:24.520
Hurry and get out of here!

00:16:24.550 --> 00:16:25.190
Yes sir!

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:49.540
Oh, Chise...

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:53.600
Oh, it's only you, Akemi.

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:55.040
Shuji...

00:16:55.090 --> 00:16:55.960
What is it?!

00:16:57.400 --> 00:16:58.130
Akemi?

00:16:58.700 --> 00:17:02.470
How can you mistake me for Chise, anyway?

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:04.770
How many years did we run together?

00:17:07.950 --> 00:17:10.460
And here I was, a cute girl offering to walk

00:17:10.510 --> 00:17:15.140
with a lonely guy all by himself.

00:17:15.490 --> 00:17:18.850
Well then, if you want to walk with someone, go with Atsu...

00:17:19.490 --> 00:17:20.290
What?

00:17:20.490 --> 00:17:21.690
Never mind.

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:28.020
Fine, fine, I got it!

00:17:28.330 --> 00:17:29.630
I'll go on ahead.

00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:41.970
I wish I could be stronger.

00:17:42.610 --> 00:17:44.340
Stronger, you said?

00:17:45.220 --> 00:17:48.010
You seem quite strong already, Commander.

00:17:48.140 --> 00:17:48.930
Really?

00:17:49.190 --> 00:17:49.880
Yes.

00:17:50.450 --> 00:17:51.780
I wonder...

00:17:53.190 --> 00:17:54.890
Here are your rations, sir.

00:17:55.390 --> 00:17:57.330
I'm not really...

00:17:57.530 --> 00:18:00.930
But today it's special: salted salmon.

00:18:01.410 --> 00:18:02.310
Salted?

00:18:04.040 --> 00:18:06.420
Oh, and you can have this, if you like.

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:08.640
I don't like milk.

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:16.980
It's good.

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:19.310
Shuji...

00:18:25.280 --> 00:18:29.330
<i>It's the first time I cried</i> <i>since we broke up.</i>

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:33.960
<i>It's hard to breathe.</i> <i>I'm so embarrassed.</i>

00:18:34.770 --> 00:18:35.870
<i>I can't stop!</i>

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:40.300
<i>I'm still in love!</i>

00:18:44.210 --> 00:18:46.610
So I talked with Akemi earlier...

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:49.780
She said we can go out!

00:18:50.050 --> 00:18:50.710
No way!

00:18:51.350 --> 00:18:52.210
It's true.

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:56.480
Good for you! She felt sorry for you, huh?

00:18:56.850 --> 00:18:58.690
That's not it, fool!

00:19:01.790 --> 00:19:04.190
Now I can fight without any regrets.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.010
You know, Atsushi...

00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:09.290
Sorry, Shuji. I've already decided.

00:19:09.690 --> 00:19:14.530
Ever since the Sapporo air raid, when Take was killed

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:16.660
right in front of me,

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:21.280
I've been thinking what I could do.

00:19:23.010 --> 00:19:26.970
I don't know what's right or wrong,

00:19:27.590 --> 00:19:33.150
but I know I have to do something.

00:19:34.460 --> 00:19:37.690
It's true I might get killed. It scares me...

00:19:38.370 --> 00:19:42.130
But maybe it's not so bad to die

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:46.140
for your family... and the girl you love.

00:19:46.230 --> 00:19:47.140
You idiot!

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:49.460
Sure, go ahead and die!

00:19:49.810 --> 00:19:53.110
You'll die when you get old anyway!

00:19:53.640 --> 00:19:56.450
And I'll come and cry at your grave!

00:19:57.180 --> 00:19:59.980
But you don't go to war to die...

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:02.320
You go to kill!

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:06.480
Can you kill for Akemi?!

00:20:07.490 --> 00:20:08.480
Can you?

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:16.040
<i>It wasn't Atsushi's enlistment</i> <i>that shocked me.</i>

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:20.860
<i>The real shock was that</i> <i>I was exposed as being someone</i>

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:23.840
<i>who is only thinking of</i> <i>his own suffering,</i>

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:28.100
<i>obsessed with my own helplessness</i> <i>and bad luck,</i>

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:32.680
<i>pretending to be Chise's boyfriend.</i>

00:20:38.050 --> 00:20:40.150
Shuji! Is this what I think it is?!

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:43.950
It sounds just like the Sapporo raid!

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:46.200
It can't be!

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:52.330
<i>Chise protects this town, but today,</i> <i>she wasn't at school.</i>

00:20:53.470 --> 00:20:55.840
<i>Today, Chise isn't here.</i>

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:57.450
Atsushi, let's get out of here!

00:20:57.540 --> 00:20:59.880
I'm going to find Akemi!

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:06.310
The aquarium!

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:18.420
They got one! Alright!

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:22.760
<i>It was Chise.</i>

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:29.500
<i>The rain smelled... different.</i>

00:21:51.320 --> 00:21:53.890
Shu...ji...?

00:22:02.330 --> 00:22:05.030
Don't... please!

00:22:05.540 --> 00:22:10.810
Shuji, we're... only classmates now.

00:22:11.850 --> 00:22:13.280
Don't...

00:22:18.120 --> 00:22:23.220
<i>Though we'd broken up...</i> <i>still I kissed her.</i>

00:22:24.420 --> 00:22:28.450
<i>We were just classmates,</i> <i>but still she cried.</i>

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:43.420
A rift opened up upon my heart

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:49.990
And I went through the night sleepless, sighing constantly

00:22:50.670 --> 00:22:59.340
Before I realize, it's turned to morning

00:23:02.280 --> 00:23:08.660
I want to hear your voice

00:23:09.180 --> 00:23:13.250
I want to feel your warmth

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:19.460
Thoughts of you well up within me

00:23:20.640 --> 00:23:25.310
And my tears begin to overflow

00:23:25.320 --> 00:23:36.570
Goodbye my beloved, I am still unable to forget about you

00:23:36.730 --> 00:23:46.740
Having all of this end with just a single word of goodbye

00:23:47.240 --> 00:23:51.570
Fills me with sorrow

00:24:01.030 --> 00:24:01.720
Chise!

00:24:01.790 --> 00:24:05.660
Part of me is falling in love with you more, and part fears you more.

00:24:05.730 --> 00:24:09.260
I don't know which to follow... They're both me!

00:24:10.430 --> 00:24:15.000
SAIKANO, Episode 7: "What I Want to Protect"
